<title>UK: REED TUMBLES AMID DOWNGRADE TALK.</title>
<headline>REED TUMBLES AMID DOWNGRADE TALK.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Reed International Plc plummeted from their earlier highs amid talk of downgrades following the company's meeting with analysts after today's trading statement, traders said.</p>
<p>The stock was down 49p at 11.01 stg by 1511 GMT after earlier trading as high as 11.89 stg.</p>
